msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:10
msgid "Create ad hoc tabs for specific products"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:11
msgid ""
"Create specific tabs to show only on specific products. For example, you "
"can add video reviews for each product or insert relevant FAQs that "
"specifically address customers’ concerns."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:17
msgid "Add tabs with an image gallery"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:18
msgid ""
"Use the “Image Gallery” layout to upload as many images as you want and "
"define how many to show per row. The plugin also integrates a lightbox "
"effect to enlarge images."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:24
msgid ""
"Add tabs with videos (video reviews, instructional or promotional videos, "
"etc.)"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:25
msgid ""
"Videos are an effective way to add interactive content to your product "
"pages and attract your customers’ attention. For example, you can use "
"videos to show usage or assembly instructions and enhance products with "
"video reviews from your customers or influencers."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:31
msgid "Create a FAQ tab to address common customer concerns"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:32
msgid ""
"The proper FAQ section can be the strength of your product pages because it "
"allows you to anticipate and answer common doubts your customers have that "
"may be preventing them from placing the order."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:38
msgid "Show a contact form on product pages"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:39
msgid ""
"The premium version includes a contact form tab, which allows users to "
"contact you quickly if they have concerns related to the product they’re "
"looking at. You can use this tab to encourage customers to request "
"information or a quote for specific products in your shop."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:45
msgid "Add files that users can download and refer to "
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:46
msgid ""
"With the premium version, you can add a “Download” layout tab to quickly "
"upload files that users can download straight from the product page (e.g. "
"technical manuals, PDF files of instructions, tables with sizes and "
"measurements, catalogs, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:52
msgid "Show a Google map"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:53
msgid ""
"Display a Google map on your product pages to share the location of your "
"store or an event, a pickup point, etc. "
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:56
msgid "Add an icon to represent each tab"
msgstr ""

#: templates/admin/premium.php:57
msgid ""
"Use icons to visually represent the content of each tab and make them more "
"interesting. You can use the icons included in the plugin or upload custom "
"images in line with the style of your shop."
msgstr ""

